DATA SOURCES / CREDIT
---------------------
This plugin gets its rates from one of two open-source projects (selected in the
plugin settings), or from a rate entered by hand:

1. priceto.day

    Project : pricedb (served as https://priceto.day)
    Author  : Hossein Margani (GitHub: margani)
    URL     : https://github.com/margani/pricedb
    API     : https://api.priceto.day  (docs: https://prices.readme.io)
    License : MIT, Copyright (c) 2024 Hossein Margani
    Data    : collected from https://www.tgju.org every 30 minutes during market hours

2. Navasan-API

    Project : Navasan-API
    Author  : Hossein (GitHub: HosseinOdd)
    URL     : https://github.com/HosseinOdd/Navasan-API
    License : "Attribution License" (a permissive MIT-style license that requires
              the copyright notice and attribution to the original author with a
              link to the original repository). GitHub lists it as "Other".
              Copyright (c) 2025 Hossein.
    Data    : collected from https://www.navasan.net

The plugin only READS the public API of priceto.day and the JSON file published in
the Navasan-API repository (data/gold.json) at runtime. No source code, data file or
other asset from either project is copied into this plugin or distributed with it.
Attribution is nevertheless given in the README, in the plugin header and on the
plugin settings page.

The data of both projects is provided without any warranty. The site administrator is
responsible for the correctness of the prices shown and for respecting the terms of use
of the original data sources (tgju.org and navasan.net).

